00:55:17,647 --> 00:55:23,647
The World Unseen is a 2007 historical romantic drama film, written and
directed by Shamim Sarif, adapted from her own novel.

11
01:00:49,411 --> 01:00:55,411
The film is set in 1950s Cape Town, South Africa
during the beginning of apartheid.

12
01:06:21,176 --> 01:06:27,176
The film stars Lisa Ray and Sheetal Sheth as two Indian South African women
who fall in love in a racist, sexist, and homophobic society.

13
01:11:52,941 --> 01:11:58,941
Ray and Sheth also star together in another Shamim Sarif movie, I
Can't Think Straight, released in November 2008.

14
01:17:24,705 --> 01:17:30,705
The World Unseen was made with the assistance of the National Film and Video
Foundation of South Africa, which took a minority equity stake in the film.

15
